          "The `transfer` function uses `_transfer` directly and returns `true` unconditionally. If `blacklisted` is intended to prevent blacklisted addresses from transferring tokens, this implementation does not enforce that rule. A blacklisted account can still transfer tokens, and a blacklisted recipient can still receive tokens.",
